-- 5. Exact existing-object tri-state checks; no CREATE OR REPLACE and no blind drop.
-- 6. BEFORE UPDATE OF public.content_chunks.embedding_g768 backstop that does not
--    block unrelated updates, with lifecycle singleton cardinality/state validation.
-- 7. Activation must take the same database lock before committing ACTIVE.
